  "limits": [
    "The selected change is a modest shallow rear hair surface improvement. The broad merged hair mass, original upper-band roughness and side color projection still need work.",
    "Depth and S paths are manual reference-informed estimates; there is no visual precision percentage or claim of perfect 360-degree reconstruction.",
    "The original low-quality triangles and near-degenerate faces are diagnosed; no new face flips or degenerate faces occur. This is not a global collision or manifold certificate.",
    "Original GLB colors, UVs, materials, topology and nine other models are preserved. Native COLOR representation follows the Blender importer.",
    "No new character rig, production approval or game integration.",
    "CI verifies exact raw source, geometry preservation, gallery reconstruction/restoration and frozen local native certificates. Actual Blender and browser verification occurred locally.",
    "The source artifact display label retains Hair-Strands from the predecessor; its exact head and source workflow bind the new Hair Sculpt payload.",
    "This local publication receipt and local source-provenance copies are outside their own Git snapshot to avoid self-reference."
